{"id": 8, "name": "Karina", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_44a9d295baa79bf949fe562ba1b15f2e.png", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["50", "70", "10", "40"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "Killer from the Dark Elf tribe who is fighting to rescue her sister Selena.", "skills": [{"name": "Shadow Combo", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fb37b0cbc5e9952ec756e3f58c5df22f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Karina's third consecutive attack on the same enemy deals extra <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> equal to 100 plus 5<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+2.5% Total Magic Power)</span>% of their lost HP (up to 2000 <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> against creeps).\n\nIf the target is an enemy hero, the cooldowns of Karina's non-Ultimate skills are reduced by 1.5s."}, {"name": "Dance of Blades", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_94328c502082dd096eb4be3d95655b07.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Karina enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dance of Blades</span> state for 3.5s, during which she gains 45% extra Movement Speed, blocks all incoming Basic Attacks, and reflects 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> back to the attacker (the damage reflection effect has a cooldown of 0.4s).\n\nKarina's next Basic Attack within the duration deals 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+55% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>, slows the target by 45% for 1s, and is guaranteed to Crit. Casting the enhanced Basic Attack or <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Assault</span> ends the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dance of Blades</span> state early."}, {"name": "Dance of Death", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da228e14f0756e84580cb08ede6a1283.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Karina launches a spinning slash, dealing 375<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+125% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies."}, {"name": "Shadow Assault", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_889d1d71cef50ed1121ee68b5097954e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 34   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "Karina dashes to the target enemy hero, dealing them 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+160% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>, applying a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Mark</span> to them, and leaving a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadowform</span> behind them. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Mark</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadowform</span> both last 5s. If the enemy dies within the duration, the cooldown of this skill is reset.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Karina dashes back to the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadowform</span>'s location, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies along the way."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Flame Hunter's Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0c5dc3bc594c58e4a2ae6f51dfee8f5f.png"}, {"name": "Starlium Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d63b0